        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I recently bough these olives to take camping. I was impressed by packaging. The pouch type of packaging with a zip lock was so convenient for packing and reusing once open. Also, very affordable given these are imported Europe. Lastly, there were very fresh tasting and impressively full of flavour. I am happy to have discovered these olives.",
