        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Bought these olives in multiple stores including, Maxi, Metro, IGA and Healthy Planet. Also, saw them on Amazon.\nThe best olives I've ever had. I tried all 12 of them. The quality of them are top ranked.\nI'll never buy another band of olives.\nI strongly recommend these olives.\nGood job Dumet Olives",
        "time": 1756837055,
        "translated": false
